  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Grande Pointe Cottage<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>This brand-new two-story home provides easy access to everything Inlet Beach and the surrounding areas offer. Bordering Camp Helen State Park, you can enjoy beautiful, unobstructed views from your home's new patio and front porch! Gorgeous 30A beaches are nearby. Use the provided adult bikes to travel one mile to the famed Gulf Coast's sugar-white sands and emerald-green waters. Enjoy Grande Pointe amenities, including a lavishly designed pavilion, a gorgeous swimming pool, and access to a community dock on Powell Lake.<br><br><br><br>Make yourself at home in the open living area replete with all-new wood flooring, furnishings, and decor. Settle in on an array of plush seating and watch a movie on the 50-inch TV. The well-appointed kitchen features everything you need to create your favorite culinary delights - all-new granite countertops, a roomy walk-in pantry, and a full suite of stainless steel appliances. When it's time to eat, perch at the kitchen island, and there's seating for everyone at the dining room table.<br><br><br><br>Comfort awaits in the tranquil main suite, highlighted by a stately bed, a 32-inch TV, and a walk-in closet. The en suite bathroom has double granite vanities and a walk-in shower.<br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b><br><br>Check-in time: 4:00 PM<br><br>Check-out time: 10:00 AM<br><br>All guests shall abide by the good neighbor policy and shall not engage in illegal activity. Quiet hours are from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM.<br><br>No smoking is permitted anywhere on the premises.<br><br>The dock access is not available for boat docking; it is intended for people only.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Brand-new house on Powell Lake near beach & 30A with pool, W&D, & gym"
        }
      ],
